  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_header.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"686\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Big Lost City 是一款全新的結構模組，部分靈感來自《失落之城》，但在本作中，這些結構會預設在世界中生成。&nbsp;當然，所有結構皆由我們從頭打造，且完全相容於其他任何結構模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>準備好與好友在頂級伺服器主機上暢玩了嗎？</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><br /></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4w7pvT1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_promo.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"267\" /></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">我推薦 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4w7pvT1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></a> 與好友一同遊玩，因為他們的伺服器品質卓越且完全無延遲。您可以無障礙地安裝任何 CurseForge 整合包或自訂模組。此外，他們的客服團隊全天候 24/7 隨時為您解決問題。使用我的代碼 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4w7pvT1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>即可在購買時享有 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X4BEeSByGU\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\" /></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_description.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">我們製作此模組的初衷，是希望能將其納入任何末日風格的整合包中。正如您在以下影片中所見，它加入了各種現代建築結構，但都已因歲月流逝而徹底荒廢。<br /></span></p>\nSome of the buildings have been inspired by a map created by tsunami.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Xh736Ry5oQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Big_Lost_City/MP_BigLostCity_screenshots.webp\" width=\"2133\" height=\"175\" /></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/90/big-lost-city-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/103/big-lost-city-3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1556/114/big-lost-city-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2133\" height=\"1200\" /></p>",
